      en: ["The original bridge was destroyed during wartime in 1979", "The new bridge was officially opened in 2004", "The construction was funded by the Japanese government", "It is a vital link on the T4 highway (Great East Road)", "The bridge spans approximately 320 meters in length", "It is located near the borders of Zambia, Zimbabwe, and Mozambique"],
