      en: ["The Lusaka Playhouse was officially established in 1958.", "The venue is located on Nasser Road in the central district of Lusaka.", "It serves as the headquarters for the Lusaka Theatre Club.", "The theater became a key site for post-independence cultural expression after 1964.", "The auditorium has a seating capacity of approximately 200 patrons.", "It is the primary venue for the annual National Theatre Arts Festival."],
